OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'was stabbed and smothered'
OL,4,Aby her friends
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman was stabbed and fatally
OL,7,Fsmothered with a pillow by her two
OL,8,Ffriends who "ransacked" her house, a
OL,9,Fjury has been told.
OL,11,FProsecutors allege that Helen
OL,12,FBloomfield, 52, was murdered by Amy
OL,13,FKeely, 40, and Charlotte James, 29, at
OL,14,Fher flat in Braintree, Essex, in March
OL,15,F2024.
OL,17,FBlood-stained scissors and shards of
OL,18,Fbroken mirror were found inside the
OL,19,Fproperty when Bloomfield's body was
OL,20,Fdiscovered a month later, Chelmsford
OL,21,FCrown Court heard.
